## 18 August 2026 | Storage & Supplier Management

Today’s work focused on refining the **Storage** and **Suppliers** sections of LabStock.

### Storage

* Refined the storage overview and expanded storage views.
* Added and refined storage creation, editing, and deletion workflows.
* Improved the overall presentation and interaction of storage cards.

### Suppliers

* Introduced supplier cards with front and back views.
* Added supplier contact details, including handling for suppliers with no contact information available.
* Added supplier inventory to the card back with scrollable inventory when required.
* Added supplier search functionality.
* Improved the Add/Edit Supplier interface by arranging fields into a more compact layout.
* Standardised inventory unit capitalisation and pluralisation.
* Refined supplier card actions and overall presentation.

The Supplier and Storage sections are now more consistent with the rest of the LabStock interface while providing more information without making the main views feel crowded.

